<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="2.6">
  <book code="2CO" style="id">- Goofa</book>
  <para style="h">2Qoronttoosa</para>
  <para style="toc3">2Qoro</para>
  <para style="toc2">2Qoronttoosa</para>
  <para style="toc1">Phawuloosi Qoronttoosa Asaas Xaafida Nam77antho Kiitaa</para>
  <para style="mt1">Phawuloosi Qoronttoosa Asaas</para>
  <para style="mt2">Xaafida Nam77antho Kiitaa</para>
  <para style="imt">Gaatha Qofaa</para>
  <para style="ip">Phawuloosi Qoronttoosa asaas xaafida nam77antho kiitay xaafettiday, iyaw Qoronttoosa woosa keethaara de7iya gaytethay daro meto giddo gelidi de7iya wodena. Issi issi woosa keetha asati Phawuloosa iita bore borikkoka Phawuloosi siga medhdhanaw iyaw amoy de7eyssa bessis. Hessi haniya wode gita ufayssaa ufayttanaw dandda7eyssa qonccisees.</para>
  <para style="ip">Phawuloosi ba kiitan koyro kifiliyan, Qoronttoosa woosa keethaara iyaw de7iya gaytethaa qonccisidi, woosa keethan medhettida boriyasinne ixuwas ays mino zaaro immidaakko odees. Hessara gathidi iya seeray entta nagaraappe zaaridi sigan gathida gisho, I ufayttida ufayssaa enttaw qonccisees. Kaallidikka, Yihudan de7iya ammaniyaa asaa maaddanaw banttaw de7iyabaappe coo immana mela hassaysees. Wurssetha shemppotan Phawuloosi ba hawaaretethaa bolla denddida mootuwas zaaro immees. Gaasoykka, Qoronttoosa woosa keethan de7iya issi issi asati banttana, “Tuma hawaare” oothidi, “Phawuloosa worddanchcho hawaare” yaagidi iya mootosona.</para>
  <para style="iot">2Qoronttoosa kiita ayfe qofata</para>
  <para style="io1">Gelo qofaa 1:1-11</para>
  <para style="io1">Phawuloosanne Qoronttoosa woosa keetha 1:12-7:16</para>
  <para style="io1">Yihudan de7iya ammaniyaa asaa maade 8:1-9:15</para>
  <para style="io1">Phawuloosi ba hawaaretetha maatas immida zaaro 10:1-13:10</para>
  <para style="io1">Kuushsha qofaa 13:11-14</para>
  <para style="ie"/>
  <chapter number="1" style="c"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Xoossaa shenen Yesuus Kiristtoosa hawaare gidida Phawuloosinne, nu ishaa Ximotiyoosi,</para>
  <para style="p">Qoronttoosan de7iya Xoossaa woosa keethaasinne Akkaya biittan de7iya Xoossaa asa ubbaas xaafida kiitaa.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 18:1">Ha@O 18:1</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v"/>Xoossaa nu Aawappenne Godaa Yesuus Kiristtoosappe, aadho keehatethaynne sarotethay hinttew gido.</para>
  <para style="s">Phawuloosi Xoossaa galatees</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v"/>Maarotetha Aawas, ubba wode nuna minthethiya Xoossaas, nu Godaa Yesuus Kiristtoosa Aawas galati gido. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Xoossay nuus immida minthethuwan, meton de7eyssata nu minthethana mela Xoossay nuna nu meto ubban minthethees. <verse number="5" style="v"/>Nuuni Kiristtoosa daro waaya shaakettidayssada qassi nuuni iya daro minthethuwan minnana. <verse number="6" style="v"/>Nuuni waayettiko hessi hinttena minthethanaassanne hinttena ashshanaassa. Qassi nuuni minettiko nuuni genccida waaya mela hintteka genccidi, Xoossay hinttew immiya minthethuwan minnana. <verse number="7" style="v"/>Hintte nu ekkida metuwa mela ekkidi, nu minthethuwan shaakettanayssa nu eriya gisho nu ufayssay hinttenan mino.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v"/>Nu ishato, Iisiya biittan nuna gakkida metuwa hintte erana mela koyoos. He nuna gakkida metoy nu wolqqaafe darin, hayqqonna attoko gidi ufayssi qanxidashin.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 15:32">1Qoro 15:32</ref></char></note> <verse number="9" style="v"/>Nuuni nu bolla hayqo pirddi pirddettida mela qoppida. Shin nuuni nu huu7en gidonnashin, hayqqidayssata denthiya Xoossan ammanettana mela hessi hanis. <verse number="10" style="v"/>Xoossay hessa mela iita hayqoppe nuna ashshis; ha77ika ashshana; sinthafekka I nuna ashshana gidi iyan ufayssi wothoos. <verse number="11" style="v"/>Woosan nuna maaddite. Daro woosa gaason Xoossaa maaduwa nu demmiya wode daro asay nu gisho Xoossaa galatoosona.</para>
  <para style="s">Phawuloosi baanaw qoppida qofaa laammis</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v"/>Nuuni nu geeshsha kahan ceeqettoos. Nuuni ha alamiyan de7ida de7uwan ubbarakka hinttera nu de7ida de7uwan tumatethaninne suuretethan hinttera de7ida. Hessika, ha alamiya cinccatethan gidonnashin, Xoossaa aadho keehatethaana. <verse number="13" style="v"/>Nu hinttew xaafida dabddaabbey hintte nabbabanawunne akeekanaw dandda7iyabaappe attin haraa gidenna. Hintte iya akeekanaw dandda7eyssa ta ammanays. <verse number="14" style="v"/>Ha77i hintte nuna hanida keena ereeta, shin sinthafe kumethi eranayssa ta ammanettays. Nu Godaa Yesuusi simmiya wode nuuni hinttenan ceeqettidayssada hintteka nunan ceeqettana.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v"/>Hessa taani loytha erida gisho, hintte nam77antho go7ettana mela kasetada hintteko baanaw qofa qachchas. <verse number="16" style="v"/>Taani Maqedooniya bashenne yaappe simmashe hinttena be7ana. Taani yaappe Yihuda biya wode hintte tana ta ogiyan maaddana gada qoppas.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 19:21">Ha@O 19:21</ref></char></note> <verse number="17" style="v"/>Taani hessa gashe ay oothanaw bessiyako eronna asi daanaynaa? Woykko taani ta qofaa qachchiya wode asa qofada, issi toho “Ee” qassi issi toho “Akkay” giya asa meleyye?</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v"/>Shin Xoossay ammanetteyssa gidiya gisho, nu hinttew odiya qaalay “Ee” woykko “Akkay” geyssa gidenna. <verse number="19" style="v"/>Taani, Sillaaseynne Ximotiyoosi hinttew markkattida Xoossaa Na7ay, Yesuus Kiristtoosi ubba wode “Eeppe” attin “Ee” nne “Akkay” gidenna.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 18:5">Ha@O 18:5</ref></char></note> <verse number="20" style="v"/>Xoossay immana gida ubbay Kiristtoosa baggara “Ee” gidees. Nuuni Kiristtoosa baggara Xoossaa bonchchoos, “Amin7i” gey hessa gishossa. <verse number="21" style="v"/>Nunanne hinttena Kiristtoosan minnidi eqqana mela oothidaynne ba oosuwas dooriday Xoossaa. <verse number="22" style="v"/>Nuuni iyabaa gideyssa erisanaw ba maatame nu bolla wothis; qassi ba Geeshsha Ayyaana oythi oothidi nu wozanan wothis.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v"/>Taani Qoronttoosa boonna aggiday hintte azanonna attana melassa; hessi worddo gidikko Xoossay ta shemppuwa taappe ekko. <verse number="24" style="v"/>Hinttee, hintte ammanuwan minnidi de7iya gisho, nu hinttena ufayssanaw hinttera issife ootheyssatappe attin hinttena wolqqan ammantheyssata gidokko.</para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <chapter number="2" style="c"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Taani nam77antho hintteko biikke gada qofa qachchiday hinttena azzanthonna agganaassa. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Taani hinttena azzanthikokka ta azzanthida hinttefe hari tana ufayssanaw de7ey oonee? <verse number="3" style="v"/>Taani hinttew he dabddaabbiya xaafiday, ta hinttena be7anaw biya wode tana ufayssanaw bessiya asan ta azzananaw koyonna gishossa. Ta ufayttiya wode hintte ubbayka ufayttanayssa ta ammanays. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Taani daro waayeninne un77an qassi daro afuthan xaafiday, hinttena azzanthanaassa gidonnashin, taani hinttena ubbaa ay mela dosiyakko hinttena erisana melassa.</para>
  <para style="s">Qohidayssa maarobaa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v"/>Ase azzanthida oonikka de7ikko ta iya balaa darssanaw koyikkefe attin tana gidonnashin, hinttefe darota azzanthis. <verse number="6" style="v"/>Hinttefe dariya asay he uraa seerida seeray iyaw gidana. <verse number="7" style="v"/>Hessa gisho, he uray daro azzanidi, ufayssi qanxonna mela hintte iya maaranawunne minthethanaw bessees. <verse number="8" style="v"/>Hintte iya siiqeyssa zaari iyaw qonccisana mela ta hinttena woossays. <verse number="9" style="v"/>Ta he dabddaabbiya hinttew xaafiday, hintte paacettidi, ubbaban taw kiitettiyako eranaw koyida gishossa. <verse number="10" style="v"/>Hintte maariya uraa takka maarana. Taani maaranabay aybi de7ikkoka, Kiristtoosa sinthan hintte gisho gada maaras. <verse number="11" style="v"/>Taani hessa oothiday Xalahiya cimo oosuwa nu eriya gisho, xalahen cimettonna attana melassa.</para>
  <para style="s">Xiro7aadan Phawuloosa un77etethaa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v"/>Taani Kiristtoosa Wonggelaa sabbakanaw Xiro7aada bida wode, Goday yan taw ooso oge giigisidi wothis.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:12-13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 20:1">Ha@O 20:1</ref></char></note> <verse number="13" style="v"/>Shin taani ta ishaa Tito yan demmaboonna gisho ta wozanay shemppibeenna. Hessa gisho, yan de7iya asaa sarothada iya koyanaw Maqedooniya bas.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v"/>Shin Kiristtoosa baggara ubba wode nuna xoonon kaalethiyanne shitto mela sawiya Kiristtoosabaa nu eriya timirttiya ubba bessi gathana mela oothiya Xoossaa galati gakko. <verse number="15" style="v"/>Nuuni attiyaa asaa giddoninne dhayiya asaa giddon Kiristtoosa baggara Xoossaas imettida sawiya shitto mela. <verse number="16" style="v"/>Dhayiya asaas hayqqoko efiya hayqo peeno; qassi attiyaa asaas de7okko efiya de7o sawo; yaatin, hessa mela oosuwas gidanay oonee? <verse number="17" style="v"/>Nuuni Xoossaa qaala wodhe demmanaw koyidi walakkidi zal77iya daro asaa mela gidokko. Shin Xoossay kiittida suure asata mela Kiristtoosan de7idi Xoossaa sinthan qaala odoos.</para>
  <chapter number="3" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Ooratha caaquwa oosanchchota</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Nuuni zaaridi nuna sabbinooyye? Woykko hara asada, saba dabddaabbiya hinttew yeddanaw woykko hinttefe ekkanaw nuna koshshiyye? <verse number="2" style="v"/>Asi ubbay hinttena erana melanne nabbabana mela hintte nu wozanan xaafettidi de7iya nu dabddaabbe. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Hintte qalamen gidonnashin, de7o Xoossaa Ayyaanan, shuchcha bolla gidonnashin, asa wozanan xaafettidayssatanne nunan haggaazettida Kiristtoosa dabddaabbe gideyssa bessideta.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 24:12">Kessa 24:12</ref>; <ref loc="JER 31:33">Er 31:33</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 11:19">Hiz 11:19</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 36:26">36:26</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v"/>Nu hessa giday, Kiristtoosa baggara Xoossan ammanoy nuus de7iya gishossa. <verse number="5" style="v"/>Nu hessa oothanaw dandda7iday Xoossaa wolqqaanappe attin nuuni nu wolqqan aykkoka oothanaw dandda7okko. <verse number="6" style="v"/>Nu ooratha caaquwa oosanchchota gidana mela Xoossay nuna dandda7isis. He ooratha caaqoy Geeshsha Ayyaanan benttidayssafe attin xaafettida higgen gidenna. Higgey wodhees, shin Geeshsha Ayyaanay de7o immees.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 31:31">Er 31:31</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v"/>Shuchcha bolla xaafettida higgey imettiya wode Xoossaa bonchchoy qonccis. Muse som77uwan de7iya bonchchoy dhayishe biyabaa gidikkoka, Isra7eele asay iya som77uwa tishshi oothidi xeellanaw dandda7ibookkona. Hiza, hayqo ehiya higgey hessa mela bonchchon qoncciko,<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 34:29">Kessa 34:29</ref></char></note> <verse number="8" style="v"/>yaatin, Geeshsha Ayyaanan oosettiya oosuwa bonchchoy waanidi aadhdhenee? <verse number="9" style="v"/>Asa bolla pirdda ehiya higgey bonchcho gidikko yaatin, ase xillisiya ooratha ogey waanidi aadhdhidi bonchchettenne? <verse number="10" style="v"/>Kase bonchcho gididayssa ha77i aadhdhiya bonchchoy de7eyssara gathi be7iya wode bonchchoy baynnabaa gidis. <verse number="11" style="v"/>Guutha wodes qonccidi guyeppe dhaydayssi hayssada bonchchetiko, merinaw de7eyssi waanidi aadhdhidi bonchchettenne?</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v"/>Nuus hayssa mela ufayssay de7iya gisho, yeellatonna odettoos. <verse number="13" style="v"/>Nuuni, Isra7eele asay dhayishe biya bonchchuwa wurssethaa be7onna mela ba som77uwa kammida Muse mela gidokko.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 34:33">Kessa 34:33</ref></char></note> <verse number="14" style="v"/>Shin entta wozanay doccis. Hachchi gakkanaw entti gal77a caaquwa nabbabiya wode entta wozanay he kaman kameti de7ees. He kamay Kiristtoosa xalaalan qaarettees. <verse number="15" style="v"/>Shin hachchi gakkanawukka entti Muse maxaafaa nabbabiya wode ubban he kamay entta wozanaa kammees. <verse number="16" style="v"/>Shin oonikka Godaakko simmiya wode awudekka he kamay qaarettees.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 34:34">Kessa 34:34</ref></char></note> <verse number="17" style="v"/>Goday Ayyaana; Godaa Ayyaanay de7iya bessan la77atethi de7ees. <verse number="18" style="v"/>Nuuni ubbay kametiboonna som77on Godaa bonchchuwa be7ana.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:18 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Be7ana: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Masttoteda zaaridi phoolisana geetetti birshshettanaw dandda7ees.</char></note> Nuuni Ayyaana gidida Godaa malaa daananaw bonchchofe bonchchon laamettana.</para>
  <chapter number="4" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Tuma hawaaretetha oosuwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Hiza, Xoossay ba maarotethan ha oosuwa nuus immida gisho, nuuni ufayssi qanxoko. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Nuuni yeellaya geema ooso ubbaa aggida; gene ooso oothoko; Xoossaa qaala worddora walakkoko. Tumaa qonccen haasayishe, asa ubbaa kahay nuna ekkana mela Xoossaa sinthan nuna shiishoos.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v"/>Nu odiya Wonggelay geemmidabaa gidikkoka, geemmiday dhayo bolla de7iya asaassa. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Ha alamiya haariya xoossay ammanonna asaa wozanaa goozis. Entti Xoossaa mela gidida Kiristtoosa bonchcho Wonggelaa poo7uwa be7onna mela diggis. <verse number="5" style="v"/>Nuuni, Yesuus Kiristtoosi Goda gideyssanne nu iya gisho hintte oosanchcho gideyssa odoosippe attin nubaa odokko. <verse number="6" style="v"/>“Dhuman poo7oy poo7o” gida Xoossay, Kiristtoosa som77uwan poo7iya Xoossaa bonchchuwa eraa poo7uwa immanaw ba poo7uwa nu wozanan poo7isis.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 1:3">Medhe 1:3</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v"/>Shin ubbaafe aadhdhiya wolqqay nubaa gidonnashin, Xoossabaa gideyssa bessanaw ha bonchcho shaloy meqqa miishe <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4:7 </char><char style="fk" closed="false">Meqqa mishe: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ha bessan meqqa miishe geetettiday biittafe oosettida miisheta bessanaassa-oto, shaate, beshe…</char></note> gidida nu asatethan de7ees.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v"/>Nu ubba baggarakka waayettida, shin meqerettibookko. Nuus haddirssi gidis, shin ufayssi qanxibookko. <verse number="9" style="v"/>Nu, morkketan goodettida, shin lagge dhayibookko. Nu morkketan shocettidi kunddida, shin dhayibookko. <verse number="10" style="v"/>Yesuusa de7oy nu asatethan qonccana mela iya hayquwa ubba wode nu asatethan tookkidi yuuyoos. <verse number="11" style="v"/>Yesuusa de7oy hayqqiya nu asatethan qonccana mela paxa de7iya nuuni iya gisho, ubba wode hayqos aadhdhidi imettoos. <verse number="12" style="v"/>Hiza, hayqoy nunan oothiya wode de7oy hinttenan oothees.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v"/>Geeshsha Maxaafan, “Ta ammanas; hessa gisho haasayas”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 116:10">Maz 116:10</ref></char></note> yaagettis. Hessa mela ammanoy nuus de7iya gisho haasayos. <verse number="14" style="v"/>Godaa Yesuusa hayquwappe denthida Xoossay, nunakka Yesuusara hayquwappe denthanayssanne hinttera issife ba sinthe shiishanayssa eroos. <verse number="15" style="v"/>Hessi ubbay haniday hintte gishossa. Xoossaa aadho keehatethay daro asaa gakkiya wode asay Xoossaa bonchchuwas daro galataa immana.</para>
  <para style="s">Ammanon de7o</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v"/>Hessa gisho, nuuni ufayssi qanxoko. Nu benttiya asatethay daaburishe biyabaa gidikkoka, nu ayyaana asatethay gallas gallas ooraxees. <verse number="17" style="v"/>Ha77is nuuni waayettiya ha kawushsha waayey, ubbaafe keehi gitatiya merinaa bonchchuwa nuus immisana. <verse number="18" style="v"/>Nuuni benttiyabaa gidonnashin, benttonnabaa xeellos. Benttiyabay ha77issa, shin benttonnabay merinaassa.</para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <chapter number="5" style="c"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Ha77i nu de7iya dunkkaane daaniya ha sa7a asatethay laalettikokka, asi keexiboonna, Xoossay keexida merinaa keethay nuus salon de7eyssa eroos. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Salo asatethaa ma77anaw amottishe ha77i ha sa7an de7ishe oolos. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Nuuni hessa ma77iya wode kallottoko. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Dunkkaane daaniya ha sa7aa ashuwan nu de7ishe deexettidi oolos. Hayqqiya nu asatethay de7on laamettana mela salo asatethaa ma77anaw koyoosippe attin ashuwappe shaakettanaw koyidi gidenna. <verse number="5" style="v"/>Nuna hayssas giigisiday Xoossaa. Qassi sinthafe yaanabaas oythi oothidi ba Ayyaana nuus immis.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v"/>Hessa gisho, nuuni ha sa7a asatethan de7iya wode ubban Godaappe haakkidi de7eyssa erikkoka ubba wode ammanettidi de7oos. <verse number="7" style="v"/>Nuuni de7ey ammanonnappe attin be7iyaban gidenna. <verse number="8" style="v"/>Nu ha sa7a asatethaafe shaakettidi, nu soo bidi Godaara issife daanaw amottiya gisho, ammanettidi de7oos. <verse number="9" style="v"/>Hessa gisho, nu ha asatethan de7in woykko ha asatethaafe shaakettin, nu amoy iya ufayssanayssa. <verse number="10" style="v"/>Nuuni issoy issoy ha sa7an de7ishe lo77o gidin woykko iita gidin, oothida oosuwas bessiya pirddaa ekkanaw Kiristtoosa pirdda araata sinthan shiiqana.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 14:10">Roome 14:10</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="s">Ase Xoossaara sigetho</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v"/>Hiza, nuuni Godaa bonchcheyssi ay guussekko eriya gisho, asay nu odeyssa ekkana mela zoroos. Xoossay, nuuni ooneekko nuna erees; qassi hintteka hintte kahan nu ooneekko ereeta yaagada qoppays. <verse number="12" style="v"/>Wozanan gidonnashin, malan ceeqettiya asaa doona oythanaw hintte nunan ceeqettana mela hinttew gaaso gidanaw koyoosippe attin nu nuna zaaridi nashshanaw koyokko. <verse number="13" style="v"/>Nu gooshshi gidikko Xoossaa bonchchossa; wozanaama gidikko hinttessa. <verse number="14" style="v"/>Issoy ubbaas hayqqidayssanne ubbay qassi iyara hayqqidayssa nu eriya gisho, Kiristtoosa siiqoy nuna haarees. <verse number="15" style="v"/>De7on de7eyssati hizappe guye banttaw gidonnashin, enttaw hayqqidayssasinne hayqoppe denddidayssas daana mela Kiristtoosi asa ubbaa gisho hayqqis.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v"/>Hizappe guye, nuuni oonakka asa qofan pirddoko. Hayssafe kase nuuni Kiristtoosakka asa qofan pirddidabaa gidikkoka, hizappe hessada pirddoko. <verse number="17" style="v"/>Hessa gisho, oonikka Kiristtoosan de7ikko ooratha medhetethi; gal77a medhetethay aadhdhis; ubbayka oorathi gidis. <verse number="18" style="v"/>Hessa ubbaa Xoossay oothis. I Kiristtoosa baggara nuna baara sigethis. Qassi harata baara sigethana mela nuus sigetho ooso immis. <verse number="19" style="v"/>Xoossay Kiristtoosa baggara asa ubbaa baara sigethees. Entta nagaraa taybibeenna; qassi asaa baara sigethiya qaala nuus immis.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v"/>Xoossay asaa nu baggara xeegiya gisho, nu Kiristtoosan kiitettidi asaa Xoossaara sigetite gidi Kiristtoosa gisho, woossos. <verse number="21" style="v"/>Nuuni Xoossaa xillotethaa Kiristtoosa baggara ekkana mela, nagara eronna Kiristtoosa nu gisho, nagaranchcho asada oothis.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5:21 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Nagaranchchcho asada: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Nagara yarshsho oothis.</char></note></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <chapter number="6" style="c"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Nuuni Xoossaara issife oothiya asi gideyssada, hintte ekkida aadho keehatethaa hada oothonna mela nu hinttena woossos. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Xoossay,</para>
  <para style="q">“Ta nena si7ana woden si7as;</para>
  <para style="q2">atotetha gallasan nena maaddas” yaagees. Hekko, ta si7iya wodey ha77i; atotetha gallasay hachchi.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 49:8">Isa 49:8</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v"/>Oonikka nu oosuwa borana melanne nunan dhubettana mela koyokko. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Gidoshin, nu tuma Xoossaa oosanchchota gideyssa nu oothiya ubbaban bessida. Daro genccan, waayen, meton, un77an, <verse number="5" style="v"/>garaafetethan, qashon, ixon kumida wocaman, daaburan, dhiskko dhayon, xooman,<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 16:23">Ha@O 16:23</ref></char></note> <verse number="6" style="v"/>geeshshatethan, eratethan, dandda7an, keehatethan, Geeshsha Ayyaanan, tuma siiqon, <verse number="7" style="v"/>tumaa haasayaninne Xoossaa wolqqan nuuni iya oosanchchota gideyssa bessida. Qassi xillotethay nuus tooranne gonddalle. <verse number="8" style="v"/>Nuuni bonchchettidanne tooshettida; cayettidanne galatettida. Tumaa haasayos, shin asay nuna worddanchcho gidosona. <verse number="9" style="v"/>Nu asan erettida asi, shin erettonna asa mela gidida. Hayqqidosona yaagettida, shin paxa de7oos; shocettida, shin hayqqibookko. <verse number="10" style="v"/>Nuuni azzanikkoka ubba wode ufayttoos. Nu manqo daanos, shin daro asaa dureyoos. Qassi aykkoyka baynna asi daanos, shin ubbay nubaa.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v"/>Qoronttoosa asato, nu hinttew qonccen odida; nu uluwaa hinttena bessida. <verse number="12" style="v"/>Hintte nuna hintte siiquwa bessonna diggidetappe attin nu nu siiquwa hinttena diggibookko. <verse number="13" style="v"/>Aawu ba naytas odeyssada ta hinttew odays; nu hinttena nu uluwaa bessidayssada, hintteka hintte uluwaa nuna bessite.</para>
  <para style="s">Ammanonna asaara de7iya issifetethaa aggo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v"/>Ammanonna asaara bessonna ogen waaxettofite. Xillotethasinne nagaras aybi gaytethi de7ii? Poo7osinne dhumas aybi issifetethi de7ii? <verse number="15" style="v"/>Kiristtoosanne Xalahe issife gathiyabay aybe? Qassi ammaneysinne ammanonnayssi issife koxiyabay aybe? <verse number="16" style="v"/>Xoossaa Keethas eeqatara aybi issifetethi de7ii? Xoossay,</para>
  <para style="q">“Taani entta giddon de7ana,</para>
  <para style="q2">entta giddon hamuttana.</para>
  <para style="q">Taani entta Xoossaa gidana;</para>
  <para style="q2">enttika ta ase gidana”</para>
  <para style="m">gidayssada, nuuni de7o Xoossaa keethi.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 26:12">Leewe 26:12</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 37:27">Hiz 37:27</ref>; <ref loc="1CO 3:16">1Qoro 3:16</ref>; <ref loc="1CO 6:19">6:19</ref></char></note> <verse number="17" style="v"/>Hessadakka, Goday,</para>
  <para style="q1">“Entta giddofe shaakettidi keyite;</para>
  <para style="q2">tuna gididabaa bochchofite;</para>
  <para style="q2">ta hinttena ekkana.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 52:11">Isa 52:11</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v"/>Ta hinttew aawa gidana;</para>
  <para style="q2">hintte taw adde naytanne macca nayta gidana;</para>
  <para style="q">yaagees Ubbaafe Wolqqaama Goday” yaagis.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 7:14">2Saamu 7:14</ref>; <ref loc="1CH 17:13">1Taari 17:13</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 43:6">Isa 43:6</ref>; <ref loc="JER 31:9">Er 31:9</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <chapter number="7" style="c"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Hiza, ta siiqoto, ha ufayssay nuus de7iya gisho, nu ashuwanne nu shemppuwa tunisiyabaa ubbaafe nuna geeshshoos. Xoossaas yayyidi nu geeshshatethaa polo oothoos.</para>
  <para style="s">Phawuloosa ufayssaa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v"/>Hintte uluwaa nuna bessite. Nuuni oonakka naaqqibookko; oonakka qohibookko; oonakka cimmibookko. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Taani hessa hintte bolla pirddanaw giikke. Hessafe kase ta hinttew odidayssada, hintte nu wozanan de7eeta; nu paxa de7inkka hayqqinkka hinttefe shaakettoko. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Ta odiyabaa hinttefe qottike; ta hinttenan ceeqettays; nu waaye ubban minettays; qassi gita ufayssi ufayttays.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v"/>Nuuni Maqedooniya bida wode, ubba baggara waayettidappe attin shemppibookko. Karera morkketan, nu gaathan yashshan un77ettida.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 2:13">2Taari 2:13</ref></char></note> <verse number="6" style="v"/>Shin azzanidayssata minthethiya Xoossay, Tito yuussan nuna minthethis. <verse number="7" style="v"/>Nuna minthethiday Tito yuussaa xalaala gidonnashin, hintteka iya minthethidayssa. Hintte tana laamoteyssa, taw azzaneyssanne taw qoppeyssa ta si7ida wode tana daro ufayssis.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v"/>Ta dabddaabbey hinttena azzanthikokka ays xaafadinaashsha gada qiirottike. Ta qiirottiday ta xaafida dabddaabbey hinttena guutha wodes azzanthida gishossa. <verse number="9" style="v"/>Ha77i taani ufayttiday, ta hinttena azzanthida gisho gidonnashin, hintte azzanoy hinttena hintte nagaraappe zaarida gishossa. Xoossay ba sheniyada hinttena azzanthisippe attin nu hinttena aybinkka qohibookko. <verse number="10" style="v"/>Xoossay koyaa azzanoy, atotethaakko gathiya nagaraappe simo ehees; iyan qiiroyabay baawa. Shin ha sa7aa azzanoy hayqo ehees. <verse number="11" style="v"/>Hintte azzanoy hinttenan ayfisida ayfiyaa be7ite. He azzanoy hinttena ay mela denthethidaakko, ay mela zaaro immanaada giigisidaakko, he uraa bolla ay mela hanqisidaakko, ay mela taw yayyana mela oothidaakko, ay mela amoyidaakko, he uraa seeranaw ay mela giigidaakko be7ite. Ha ubbaban hintte geeshshi gideyssa markkayideta.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v"/>Hessa gisho, taani ha dabddaabbiya hinttew xaafiday, naaqqida uraa woykko naaqettida uraa gisho gidenna. Shin hintte nuus ay mela qoppiyako Xoossaa sinthan hinttee, hinttena be7ana mela xaafas. <verse number="13" style="v"/>Nuuni ufayttiday hessa gishossa. Nu ufayssaafe aadhdhidi nuna daro ufayssiday, hintte Tito ufayssidayssanne iya wozanaa shemppisidayssa. <verse number="14" style="v"/>Taani hinttena nashshada iyaw odin hintte tana yeellayibeekketa. Shin nuuni ubba wode hinttew tumaa odida; hessadakka nuuni Tito sinthan hinttena nashshidayssi tuma gidis. <verse number="15" style="v"/>Hintte iyaw yashshan kokkoridi, iya mokkidayssa qassi iyaw ay mela kiitettidaakko I qoppiya wode hinttew de7iya siiqoy minnishe bis. <verse number="16" style="v"/>Taani ubbaban hinttenan ammanettiya gisho ufayttays.</para>
  <chapter number="8" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Imobaa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Nu ishato, Xoossay Maqedooniyan de7iya woosa keethatas immida aadho keehatethaa hintte erana mela nu koyoos.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:1-4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 15:26">Roome 15:26</ref></char></note> <verse number="2" style="v"/>Entti gita meton paacettidosona, shin entta ufayssay wolqqaama. Entta manqotethaas zawi baawa, shin bantta imuwan daro keehidosona. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Entti bantta wolqqaa melanne bantta wolqqaafe aadhdheyssa dosidi immidayssas ta markka. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Entti Xoossaa asaa maaddiya lo77o ooso nuura oothanaw koyidi nuna daro woossidosona. <verse number="5" style="v"/>Entti nuuni qoppidayssafe aathidi oothidosona. Koyrottidi banttana Godaas immidosona; kaallidi, Xoossaa sheniyada banttana nuus immidosona.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v"/>Ha lo77o oosuwa doommida Titoy gujji oothanaadanne hinttena maaddidi, he oosuwa polisanaada iya woossida. <verse number="7" style="v"/>Shin hintte ubbaban, ammanon, haasayan, eratethan, gita amon, nuna siiqoninne ubbaban durettidayssada ha lo77o oosuwankka hintte keeha gidana mela nu koyoos.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v"/>Taani hessa kiittanaw giikke. Shin harata gita amuwaa hintte siiquwara gatha be7ada hintte ay keena tumeekko eranaw gays. <verse number="9" style="v"/>Hintte nu Godaa Yesuus Kiristtoosa aadho keehatethaa ereeta. Kiristtoosi dure gidi uttidi, hintte iya manqotethan duretanaada hintte gisho manqis.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v"/>Taani ha odan hinttena maaddiya zore zoranaw koyays. Hintte zillaythi immanaw xalaala gidonnashin, hessa oothanaw amotethankka hintte koyro. <verse number="11" style="v"/>Hintte oothanaw doomida oosuwa ha77i polite. Hintte hinttew de7eyssa keena immiko, hessi hintte immanaw daro amotteyssa qonccisees. <verse number="12" style="v"/>Issi asi immanaw amottiko, iya imoy Xoossaa sinthan ekettey, I baw de7idayssa keena imminappe attin baynnabaappe immanaw un77ettin gidenna.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v"/>Taani hessa gey, hintte ubbay issi gina gidana melassafe attin harati waayappe shemppin hintte waayettana melassa gidenna. <verse number="14" style="v"/>Wode entta palahay hintte pacaa kunthana mela ha77i hintte palahay entta pacaa kuntho. Hessan hintte gina gidana. <verse number="15" style="v"/>Geeshsha Maxaafan, “Daro shiishidayssas palahibeenna; guutha shiishidayssas paccibeenna” geetetti xaafettidayssa mela.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 16:18">Kessa 16:18</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="s">Titonne iya laggeta</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v"/>Nu hinttew qoppeyssada Titoykka hinttew qoppana mela oothida Xoossay galatetto. <verse number="17" style="v"/>Titoy hintteko biday, nu iya denthethida gisho xalaala gidonnashin, I ba shenen baanaw amottida gishossa. <verse number="18" style="v"/>Wonggelaa markkatethan woosa keetha ubban daro erettida ishaa, nuuni Titora issife kiittoos. <verse number="19" style="v"/>Hessa bolla nuuni ha keeha imotaa efiya wode nuura baana mela ha lo77o oosuwan Godaa bonchchanawunne harata maaddanaw de7iya amuwa bessanaw I woosa keethatan doorettis.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v"/>Ha imettida keeha imuwa, nu ooso bolla peeshshiya wode borettonna mela naagettoos. <verse number="21" style="v"/>Nuuni Godaa sinthan xalaala gidonnashin, asa sinthankka lo77o gididabaa oothoos.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PRO 3:4">Leemi 3:4</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v"/>Qassi daro wode paacen minnidi aadhdhida nu ishaa, enttara hintteko kiittida. I hinttenan keehi ammanettiya gisho, ha77i hinttena maaddanaw daro amottees. <verse number="23" style="v"/>Titobaa eranaw koykko, I hinttena maaddanaw taara oothiya ta ooso laggiya. Hankko ishatabaa gidikko woosa keethati kiittidayssata; qassi asay entta duussaa be7idi Kiristtoosa bonchchosona. <verse number="24" style="v"/>Hessa gisho, woosa keethati hintte siiquwanne nu hinttena nashsheyssi tuma gideyssa qonccisanaw hintte siiquwa ha asata bessite.</para>
  <chapter number="9" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Ammaniya asaas kessida miishiya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Ammaniya asaas kessiya miishiyabaa ta hinttew xaafanaw koshshenna. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Hintte maaddanaw keehi amotteyssa ta erays. Hintte Akkaya asay, zillaythafe doomidi maaddanaw giigettidayssa taani Maqedooniya asaas doona kunthada odas. Hintte gita amoykka enttafe darota denthethis. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Ha oosuwan hinttenan nu ceeqettiya ceeqoy hada gidonna mela koyro hinttebaa ta odidayssada hintte giigettidi naagana mela ha ishata hintteko kiittas. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Maqedooniya asay taara bidi, hintte giigettonna de7ishin, demmiko, nu hinttenan yeellatana; qassi hintte nuuppe aadho yeellatana. <verse number="5" style="v"/>Hessa gisho, ha ishati taappe sinthattidi hintteko bidi, hintte immana gida imuwa kasetidi giigisana mela ta enttana kiittas. Taani gakkiya wode he imoy giigi uttees. He wode he keehatetha imoy wolqqan gidonnashin, dosan gideyssa erisees.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v"/>Hayssa akeekite; guuthu zeriday guuthu cakkana; daro zeriday daro cakkana. <verse number="7" style="v"/>Xoossay ufayssan immiya uraa dosiya gisho, wolqqan woykko dosi baynna gidonnashin, issi issi asi ba wozanan qoppidayssada dosan immanaw bessees. <verse number="8" style="v"/>Ubba wode ubbaban koshshiyaba ubbaa demmidi lo77o ooso ubbaa oothanaw dandda7ana mela Xoossay hinttew ba anjjuwaa darssana. <verse number="9" style="v"/>Geeshsha Maxaafan,</para>
  <para style="q">“I ba shaluwa manqotas laallis;</para>
  <para style="q2">iya xillotethay merinaw de7ana” yaagees.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 112:9">Maz 112:9</ref></char></note> <verse number="10" style="v"/>Zereyssas zerethi, maanaw kathi immiya Goday, hintte zeriya zerethaa darssidi immana. Hintte xillotethaa ayfiyaakka darssana.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 55:10">Isa 55:10</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v"/>Daro asay hintte immiya imuwa nuuppe ekkidi, Xoossaa galatanaada, hintte ubba wode darssidi immeyssata gidana mela, Xoossay hinttena ubba baggara dureyana. <verse number="12" style="v"/>Ha hintte immiya imoy ammaniyaa asaa pacaa kuntho xalaala gidonnashin, asay Xoossaa galatanaw gaaso gidees. <verse number="13" style="v"/>Ha hintte oosoy hintte ammanuwa ersidi Kiristtoosa Wonggelaa hintte ammanidinne iyaw kiitettidi hinttew de7iyabaa enttaranne haratara shaakettida gisho ubbay Xoossaa bonchchana. <verse number="14" style="v"/>Xoossay hinttew immida aadho keehatethaa gisho entti hinttew Xoossaa woossishe hinttena be7anaw laamotosona. <verse number="15" style="v"/>Zawi baynna Xoossaa imuwas Xoossay galatetto.</para>
  <chapter number="10" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Phawuloosi mooteyssatas zaarida zaaruwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Ta hinttera de7iya wode shugo, qassi hinttefe haakkiya wode nu bolla minnees yaagettida, Phawuloosi, keehanne ashkke gidida Kiristtoosa sunthan hinttena woossays. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Taani hintteko biya wode nu asho qofara simerettiya asi oothidi qoppiya asaa bolla mino qaalan odettanaw qachchas. Hintte bolla hessada odettana mela hintte tana oothonnaada hinttena woossays. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Nuuni ha sa7an de7ikkoka ha sa7aa asada olettoko. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Nu ola miishey ha sa7ayssa gidenna. Shin miixa laallanaw wolqqara de7iya Xoossaa toora. Tumaara eqettiya palamaanne, <verse number="5" style="v"/>Xoossaa eronna mela diggiya otoro qofa ubbaa laalloos. Asa qofa ubbaa di77idi Kiristtoosas kiitettana mela oothoos. <verse number="6" style="v"/>Hintte kiitettethay polo gidiya wode nuuni kiitetetha ixo ubbaa seeranaw giigettana.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v"/>Hintte ayfey be7ida mela pirddeeta. Oonikka bana Kiristtoosabaa gidi qoppiyabaa gidikko, nukka Kiristtoosabaa gideyssa ero. <verse number="8" style="v"/>Goday taw immida maatan ceeqetikokka hessan yeellatikke. He maatay taw imettiday hinttena dichchanaassafe attin qohanaassa gidenna. <verse number="9" style="v"/>Taani ta dabddaabbiyan hinttena yashisanaw koyada xaafidabaa daanoppo. <verse number="10" style="v"/>Issi issi asay, “Phawuloosa dabddaabbey deexonne wolqqaama, shin iya som77on be7iya wode I daaburanchcho; iya odaykka pathenna” yaagosona. <verse number="11" style="v"/>He asati nu haahon de7ishe xaafiya dabddaabbiyaninne matan hinttera de7ishe oothiya oosuwa giddon dummatethi baynnayssa akeeko.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v"/>Nuuni banttana nashshiya asatara nuna ginayanaw woykko gaaddeyanaw koyokko. Shin entti banttana banttara ginayidi woykko gaaddeyidi be7ishe eeya.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v"/>Shin nuuni Xoossay nuus immida dhassan ceeqettoosippe attin zawaa pinnidi ceeqettoko; he zaway hinttekokka gakkees. <verse number="14" style="v"/>Nuuni besseyssafe aathidi ceeqettoko, shin Kiristtoosa Wonggelaa hintteko gathidayssan ceeqettoos. <verse number="15" style="v"/>Nuuni Xoossay essida zawappe pinnidi, harati oothida ooson ceeqettoko. Gidoshin, hintte ammanoy diccana mela Xoossay immida zawan hintte giddon nu oothiya oosoy dalggana gidi qoppoos. <verse number="16" style="v"/>Nuuni hara asi ba zawan oothida ooson gelidi ceeqettoko, shin hinttefe pinnidi haratas Wonggelaa markkattanaw dandda7os. <verse number="17" style="v"/>Shin, Geeshsha Maxaafan, “Ceeqqiya ubbay Godaa lo77otethan ceeqqo” yaagidi xaafettis.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 9:24">Er 9:24</ref></char></note> <verse number="18" style="v"/>Goday nashshiya uraappe attin bana baw nashshiya uray nashettenna.</para>
  <chapter number="11" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Phawuloosanne worddanchcho hawaareta</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Ta guutha eeyatethaa hintte ha77ika dandda7ana gada qoppays; hayyana dandda7ite. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Xoossay hinttew qoppidaysssada, takka hinttew qoppays. Taani hinttena geeshsha geela7ida issi addiya, Kiristtoosas immanaw oychcha wothas.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v"/>Shin shooshay ba geniyan Hewaano balethidayssada ooni eri hintte wozanay iitidi Kiristtoosas de7iya hintte suuretethaanne geeshshatethaa agganddetii gada hirggays.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 3:1-5">Medhe 3:1-5</ref></char></note> <verse number="4" style="v"/>Issi asi yidi, nuuni hinttew markkattida Yesuusappe hara Yesuusa hinttew markkatiko, woykko hintte ekkida Ayyaanaappenne Wonggelaappe hara ayyaananne Wonggelaa hinttew odikko, si7i gidi ekkeeta.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v"/>Shin taani Yesuus kiittida “Gita hawaaretappe” guuxays gada qoppike. <verse number="6" style="v"/>Taani oda eronna asi gidikkoka, eratethi taw de7ees. Hessa ta hinttew daro ogen qonccisas.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v"/>Taani miishe oychchonna Xoossaa Wonggelaa hinttew coo odidaysinne hinttena dhoqqu oothada tana toochchidayssi taw nagara gidi? <verse number="8" style="v"/>Taani hinttew oothanaw hara woosa keethatappe miishe bonqa ekkas. <verse number="9" style="v"/>Ta hinttera de7iya wode tana metinkka hinttefe issi asikka waaysabiikke. Maqedooniyappe yida ammaneyssati tana koshshiyaba ubban maaddidosona. Hachchi gakkanaw ta hinttew tooho gidabiikke sinthaskka tooho gidikke.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PHP 4:15-18">Fil 4:15-18</ref></char></note> <verse number="10" style="v"/>Kiristtoosa tumatethay tanan de7ishin, ta ceequwa Akkaya biittan tana oonikka diggenna. <verse number="11" style="v"/>Ta hayssa ays gaynaa? Hinttena dosonna gishosseyye? Taani hinttena doseyssa Xoossay erees.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v"/>Nukka entta mela oothoos yaagidi ceeqqiya hankko hawaareta ceequwa gaasuwa dhayssanaw ha77i ta ootheyssa sinthaskka oothana. <verse number="13" style="v"/>Hayssa mela asati Kiristtoosa hawaare daananaw banttana laammiya worddanchcho hawaaretanne cimmiya oosanchchota. <verse number="14" style="v"/>Hessi malaalisiyabaa gidenna; ays giikko, Xalahey poo7o kiitanchcho daananaw bana laammees. <verse number="15" style="v"/>Hessa gisho, Xalahe oosanchchoti xillotethaa oosanchchota daananaw banttana laammiko hessi gitabaa gidenna. Entti wurssethan bantta oosuwada ekkana.</para>
  <para style="s">Phawuloosa gakkida metuwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v"/>Oonikka tana eeya gidi qopponna mela zaaradakka odays. Ta hinttew eeya daanikkoka ta guuthara ceeqettana mela tana eeya oothidi ekkite. <verse number="17" style="v"/>Taani hayssada ceeqettada odettey, Godaa koyeyssada gidonnashin, eeyatethan odays. <verse number="18" style="v"/>Daro asay ha sa7aaban ceeqettey gisho, takka ceeqettana. <verse number="19" style="v"/>Hintte wozanaama gidiya gisho, eeya asabaa ufayssan dandda7eeta. <verse number="20" style="v"/>Oonikka hinttena aylleykko woykko hinttena bonqiko woykko baw maadettanaw hintteko shiiqikko woykko hintte bolla otortiko woykko hinttena baqqiko hintte dandda7eeta. <verse number="21" style="v"/>Nuuni hessa oothanaw daro daaburanchcho gideyssa yeellatashe ta odays.</para>
  <para style="p">Shin oonikka minnidi ceeqqettiko, takka ceeqqettanaw minnays. Taani hessa eeya asada odettays. <verse number="22" style="v"/>Entti Ibraawe? Takka Ibraawe. Entti Isra7eele? Takka Isra7eele. Entti Abrahaame sheeshee? Takka Abrahaame sheeshi. <verse number="23" style="v"/>Entti Kiristtoosa oosanachcho? Taani gooyiya asada odays, enttafe aadhdhiya Kiristtoosa oosanchcho. Taani ooson daro daaburas; daro wode qashettas; garaafettas; daro wode hayqoppe attas.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 16:23">Ha@O 16:23</ref></char></note> <verse number="24" style="v"/>Ayhudeti tana hasttamanne uddufuna ichchashu toho garaafidosona.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 25:3">Zaare 25:3</ref></char></note> <verse number="25" style="v"/>Heedzu toho xam77an shocettas; issi toho shuchchan cadettas; markkabey heedzu toho me77is; abbaa giddon issi qamma kumethi aqada pee7as.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:25 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 16:22">Ha@O 16:22</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 14:19">14:19</ref></char></note> <verse number="26" style="v"/>Taani daro ogiya daaburan hamuttas. Kixa haathafenne panggafe attas. Ayhudetinne Ayhude gidonna asay ta bolla meto gathidosona. Katamay, bazzoy, abbay, tana yashshis; ammaniyaa daaniya asati tana waaysidosona.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:26 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 9:23">Ha@O 9:23</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 14:15">14:15</ref></char></note> <verse number="27" style="v"/>Taani ooson daaburasinne cawattas, daro toho dhiskko dhayas, koshattas, saamottas, daro toho xoomas, meegettas, kallottas.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v"/>Haraba ubbaa taybonna ubba wode tana qofisey woosa keethatabaa. <verse number="29" style="v"/>Issi asi daaburiya wode iyara ta daaburabiikinna? Issi asi nagaran dhubettiya wode ta awude qiirottonna aggadina?</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v"/>Ta ceeqettanaw koshshiyabaa gidikko taani daaburanchcho gideyssa erisiyaban ceeqettana. <verse number="31" style="v"/>Merinaw bonchchettida Xoossay, nu Godaa Yesuus Kiristtoosa Aaway, ta worddotonnayssa erees. <verse number="32" style="v"/>Damasqqo kataman Aretaasa giya kawuwappe garssara haareyssi tana oythanaw koyidi Damasqqo katamaa penggiya naagisis.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:32-33 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 9:23-25">Ha@O 9:23-25</ref></char></note> <verse number="33" style="v"/>Shin asay tana daachchon yeggidi, katamaa dirssaa maskkootiyara wodhisin taani iya kushiyappe attas.</para>
  <chapter number="12" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Phawuloosa qonccethaa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Ceeqetethas go77i baynnayssa erays. Shin ceeqettanaw koshshiko, Godaappe ekkida qonccethan ceeqqana. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Tammanne oyddu laythafe kase, Kiristtoosa ammaniyaa issi uray heedzantho saluwa bidayssa ta erays. He uray ashon woykko ashoppe karera bidaakko ta erikke; Xoossay erees. <verse number="3" style="v"/>He uray heedzantho saluwa ekettidayssa erays. Shin I ashon woykko ashoppe karera ekettidaakko ta erikke; Xoossay erees. <verse number="4" style="v"/>He uray gannate ekettidi asi qonccisanawunne asi odanaw dandda7onnabaa si7is. <verse number="5" style="v"/>Taani he addiyaban ceeqettana, shin taani ta daaburaappe attin tanan ceeqettiyabay baawa. <verse number="6" style="v"/>Taani tumaa odettiya gisho, ceeqettanaw koykkoka eeya gidikke. Shin asi ta ootheyssa be7eyssafenne si7eyssafe aathidi qoppona mela gada ceeqetethi aggays.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v"/>Taw qonccida gita qonccethan ta otorttonna mela tana waaysanaw ta ashuwan caddiya Xalahiya kiitanchchoy taw imettis. <verse number="8" style="v"/>Ha waaysiyaba taappe diggana mela taani Godaa heedzu toho woossas. <verse number="9" style="v"/>Shin Goday, “Ta wolqqay ne daaburan qoncciya gisho ta aadho keehatethay new gidana” yaagis. Kiristtoosa wolqqay tanan qonccana mela ta daaburan ufayttashe ceeqettays. <verse number="10" style="v"/>Taani Kiristtoosa gisho, daaburiya wode cayettiya wode waayettiya wode goodettiya wode metootiya wode ta daaburan ufayttays. Ays giikko, ta daaburiya wode, he wode minnays.</para>
  <para style="s">Phawuloosi Qoronttoosa asaas qoppees</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v"/>Taani eeya asada ceeqettas. Hessada ta ceeqettana mela oothiday hinttena. Ta, ta huu7en erettonna asi gidikkoka, “Gita hawaareta” geetetteyssatappe guuxike. Hessa taw markkattanaw bessey hinttenashin. <verse number="12" style="v"/>Ta hintte giddon de7ashe dandda7an oothida malaatatinne mallati ta tuma hawaare gideyssa bessosona. <verse number="13" style="v"/>Ta hinttew tooho gidonnayssafe attin hara woosa keethatappe hintte aybin guuxidetii? Hessi bala gidikko tana maarite.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v"/>Taani hintteko baanaw giigettishin hayssi taw heedzantho. Ta hinttenappe attin hinttew de7iyabaa koyonna gisho hinttena waaysanaw koyikke. Yelidayssati bantta naytas shalo minjjoosonappe attin nayti banttana yelidayssatas shalo minjjokona. <verse number="15" style="v"/>Ta hintte gisho, taw de7iyabaanne tana aatha imminkka tana ufayssees. Yaatin, taani hinttena hessada keeha siiqiya wode hintte tana guuthara siiqetii?</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v"/>Gidikkoka, ta hinttew tooho gidikke; waaysabiikke; shin hinttena cimoninne genen oykkidabaa hinttew daanonna aggenna. <verse number="17" style="v"/>Hari attoshin, ta hintteko kiittida asatappe hinttena cimmida asi de7ii? <verse number="18" style="v"/>Titoy hintteko baana mela taani woossas; qassi ammaniyaa ishaakka iyara yeddas. Yaatin, Titoy hinttena cimmide? Nuuni nu oosuwa issi ayyaanan oothibookko? Qassi nu hanoykka issino gidennee?</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v"/>Nu ubba wode hintte sinthan nuna xillisanaw mootettiyabaa hinttew daanii? Nu Kiristtoosan de7idi Xoossaa sinthan ha77i gakkanaw odoos. Nu siiqo ishato, nu ha ubbaa oothey hinttena dichchanaassa. <verse number="20" style="v"/>Ta hintteko biya wode ooni eri hintte ta koyeyssada hanonna, qassi takka hintte koyeyssada hanonna gayttonna aggoko gada yayyays. Qassi ooni eri hintte giddon palami, qanaatey, hanqoy, yiiqey, zigirssi, asa sunthu iisoy, otoroynne kachchi doonna aggenna gada yayyays. <verse number="21" style="v"/>Taani nam77antho hintteko biya wode Xoossay hintte sinthan tana kawushshana gada yayyays. Kase nagara oothidi he bantta oothida tunatethaafe, laymatethafenne yeellayiya oosuwappe simmiboonna asata be7ada azzanonna aggike gada yayyays.</para>
  <chapter number="13" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Wurssetha zorenne sarotho</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Ta hintteko bishin hayssi heedzantho. Ay mootoykka nam77u woykko heedzu markkan minnees.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 17:6">Zaare 17:6</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 19:15">19:15</ref></char></note> <verse number="2" style="v"/>Taani nam77antho hinttera gayttida wode hintte giddon kase nagara oothida uraanne harata ubbaa seeronna aggike gada oda wothas. Ha77i ta haakkada de7ikkoka simmada hintteko biya wode oodeskka qadhettike.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v"/>Tanan de7idi odey Kiristtoosa gideyssa hintte eranaw koyeeta. I hinttera haasayiya wode wolqqaamappe attin hintte giddon daaburanchcho gidenna. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Kiristtoosi masqaliya bolla daaburan kaqettis, shin Xoossaa wolqqan de7on de7ees. I daaburanchcho gididayssada, nukka daaburanchcho. Shin hinttena haggaazanaw Xoossaa wolqqan iyara de7on daana.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v"/>Ammanon minnidi de7iyakko hinttena hinttew paaci be7ite. Paacen hintte kunddonna attiko, Kiristtoosi hinttenan de7eyssa hintte ereeta. Shin Kiristtoosi hinttenan doonna ixxiko hintte kunddeeta. <verse number="6" style="v"/>Nuuni paacen kunddonayssa hintte ereeta gada ammanays.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v"/>Hintte iitabaa oothenna mela nuuni Xoossaa woossos. Nuuni mino gideyssa asay be7ana mela gidonnashin, nuuni mino gidonna ixxikokka, hintte lo77o oothana mela nuuni woossos. <verse number="8" style="v"/>Nuuni tumaas oothoosippe attin tumaara eqettiyabaa aybaakka oothoko. <verse number="9" style="v"/>Nu daaburiya wode hintte qassi minniya wode nuna ufayssees. Hintte borey baynnayssata gidana mela nu hinttew Xoossaa woossos.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v"/>Taani hinttefe haakkada de7ashe xaafiday hessa gishossa. Taani hintteko biya wode Goday taw immida maatan zemppada hintte bolla godattanaw koyikke. Goday taw maata immiday, hinttena maaddanaassafe attin qohanaassa gidenna.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v"/>Wurssethan ta ishato, saro de7ite. Borey baynna de7ite; ta zoriya si7ite. Issi wozanan gididi de7ite; sarotethan de7ite. Siiqonne saro immiya Xoossay hinttera gido.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v"/>Geeshsha yeeretethi yeerettishe, issoy issuwa sarothite. <verse number="13" style="v"/>Xoossaa asay ubbay hinttena saro saro yaagosona.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v"/>Godaa Yesuus Kiristtoosa aadho keehatethay, Xoossaa siiqoy, Geeshsha Ayyaana issifetethay hintte ubbaara gido.</para>
</usx>
